; IPL-V program to reverse a list
; This demonstrates basic list manipulation

J0 H1 S0 L0 =C(A)
J1 H2 S1 L1 =C(B)
H3 S2 L2 0
H4 S3 L3 S0
H5 S4 L4 S1
H6 J2 L5
J2 H7 S5 L6 =C(S2)
H8 S6 L7 =C(S3)
H9 S7 L8 S5
H10 S8 L9 S6
H11 S2 L10 S7
H12 S3 L11 S8
H13 J3 L12
J3 H14 S9 L13 =C(S3)
H15 J4 S9 L14 0
J4 H16 S10 L15 =C(S2)
H17 J0 L16
